    {
      "section": "@supanexus/dsh-plugin-supanexus-core",
      "text": "中文 · [English](./README.en.md)\n\nSupaNexus 平台核心：品牌样式、OAuth 快速配置、双线路模型接入，以及应用插件市场。\n\n仓库：[GitHub](https://github.com/supanexus/dsh-plugin-supanexus-core)"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:supanexus/dsh-plugin-supanexus-core#v0.3.6\n```\n\n安装后请**完全重启** `dsh web`（或 Desktop Host），并用打印的 `?token=` 地址打开。"
    },
    {
      "section": "能做什么",
      "text": "- **品牌**：侧栏 Logo/名称、对话区标识与浏览器标签页切换为 SupaNexus 样式（可在设置中关闭）\n- **快速配置**：设置 → 模型页底部一键授权；按插件配置「访问区域」钉死 Global / 中国大陆线路（首次自动选最快）\n- **访问区域**：插件配置内可切换全球 / 中国大陆；授权、控制台、余额跟区域线；插件市场下载仍独立按网络探测\n- **应用插件**：侧栏「应用插件」浏览、安装、升级、卸载社区与运营插件\n- **余额入口**（可选）：侧栏余额默认关闭，可在设置 → 插件配置中开启"
    },
    {
      "section": "怎么用",
      "text": "1. 安装并重启后，打开设置 → 模型\n2. 在底部「快速配置」完成浏览器授权\n3. 模型列表出现 **SupaNexus** 后即可选用；需要装其它插件时打开侧栏「应用插件」"
    },
    {
      "section": "说明",
      "text": "- 卸载本插件后，已写入的 SupaNexus 提供方与 API Key **仍会保留**\n- 品牌与余额显示可在设置 → 插件配置中调整"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT © SupaNexus"
    },
    {
      "section": "@supanexus/dsh-plugin-supanexus-core",
      "text": "[中文](./README.md) · English\n\nSupaNexus platform core: branding, OAuth quick setup, dual-line model provider, and the app plugin market.\n\nRepo: [GitHub](https://github.com/supanexus/dsh-plugin-supanexus-core)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:supanexus/dsh-plugin-supanexus-core#v0.3.6\n```\n\nFully restart `dsh web` (or Desktop Host) after install, then open the printed `?token=` URL."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "- **Branding** — sidebar logo/name, conversation chrome, and browser tab (can be turned off in settings)\n- **Quick setup** — one-click OAuth under Settings → Models; probes Global / China lines and writes the provider\n- **App plugins** — browse, install, upgrade, and uninstall plugins from the sidebar market\n- **Balance** (optional) — sidebar balance is off by default; enable it under plugin settings"
    },
    {
      "section": "How to use",
      "text": "1. Install and restart, then open Settings → Models\n2. Complete browser authorization via Quick Setup at the bottom\n3. Pick **SupaNexus** from the model list; open **App Plugins** in the sidebar to install more"
    },
    {
      "section": "Notes",
      "text": "- Uninstalling this plugin does **not** remove an already-written SupaNexus provider or API key\n- Brand and balance toggles are available under Settings → Plugins"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT © SupaNexus"
    }
  ],
